<title>USA: Big B sets payout, tender affects dividend.</title>
<headline>Big B sets payout, tender affects dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BESSEMER, Ala. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Big B Inc said on Thursday that it set a unchanged dividend of $0.05 a share, but shareholders who tender their shares to Revco D.S. Inc will not receive the dividend.</p>
<p>The $17.25 a share tender offer by Revco for Big B's stock expires November 15, 1996 at 0900 EST.</p>
<p>If Revco closes the offer without extending it, the Big B shareholders that tendered their shares will not receive the dividend because they would not be shareholders of record.</p>
<p>The record date for the dividend is November 29, 1996 and the dividend is payable December 13, 1996, Big B said.</p>
</text>
